<title>USA: Bird Corp says agency takes no action.</title>
<headline>Bird Corp says agency takes no action.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bird Corp said the U.S. Department of Justice advised the company that it has closed its antitrust investigation against the company without taking any action.</p>
<p>The investigation was over restraint of trade by manufacturers in the roofing industry, Bird Corp said.</p>
<p>In April, Bird said it had received subpoenas to provide documents to the department.</p>
</text>
